<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><title>Sectioning and ruby</title></head>
<body>
<header><hgroup><h1>Main <small>heading</small><h2>Subtitle</h2></hgroup>
<nav><a href="#one">one<a href="#two">two</nav></header>
<main>
<article id=one>
<h2>Article</h2>
<section><h3>Part A</h3><p>Text
<aside><h4>Aside</h4><p>note</aside>
<p>Continuation without closing elements
<figure><img src=x alt="a & b"><figcaption>caption</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<ruby>漢<rt>kan<rp>(</rp><rt>bad pronunciation</ruby>
<details open><summary>Summary</summary><p>Hidden-ish content</details>
</article>
<article id=two><h2>Second</h2><blockquote cite="x"><p>quote<q>nested quote</blockquote>
</main>
<footer><address>mail <a href="mailto:a@b">contact</a></address></footer>
</body>
</html>